flowchart LR
    G[Tracked repository snapshot] --> C{Clean commit?}
    C -->|dirty| X[Fail closed; no Knowledge build]
    C -->|clean| A{SOURCE_ALLOWLIST}
    A -->|unapproved source| X
    A -->|approved sources| B[Deterministic canonical records]
    B --> M[chappie_knowledge/1.0.0<br/>manifest + content digest]
    M --> R{Retrieval verifies store,<br/>manifest, provenance}
    R -->|mismatch/stale| X
    R -->|valid| K[chappie_knowledge_retrieval/1.3.0]
    K --> Q[Bounded AI / Development context]
    Q --> N[Knowledge is not model memory<br/>and grants no mutation authority]

    classDef gate fill:#fee2e2,stroke:#b91c1c,stroke-width:2px
    classDef data fill:#dbeafe,stroke:#1d4ed8
    class C,A,R gate
    class B,M,K data
